Zero point energy                ...      0.24000224 Eh     150.60 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.01357310 Eh       8.52 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
